{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%lld photos saved and signed.": {
      "comment": "Shown after an exposure bracket: each frame was added to the photo library as its own photo, each with a Content Credentials signature. The number is the count of photos, at least 3. Honesty wording: says only that they were saved and signed.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%lld Fotos gesichert und signiert."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%lld fotos guardadas y firmadas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%lld photos enregistrées et signées."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%lld foto salvate e firmate."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%lld 枚の写真を保存し、署名しました。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "사진 %lld장을 저장하고 서명했습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%lld foto’s bewaard en ondertekend."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%lld fotos salvas e assinadas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "已保存并签名 %lld 张照片。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "已儲存並簽署 %lld 張照片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each frame is a separate single-frame photo. Nothing is merged.": {
      "comment": "Explains exposure bracketing. Must not claim more than the English: the photos are never combined.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Jedes Bild ist ein eigenes Einzelbildfoto. Nichts wird zusammengeführt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cada fotograma es una foto independiente de un solo fotograma. No se combina nada."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Chaque image est une photo distincte à image unique. Rien n’est fusionné."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Ogni fotogramma è una foto separata a fotogramma singolo. Nulla viene unito."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "各フレームは個別の単一フレーム写真です。合成は行いません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "각 프레임은 별도의 단일 프레임 사진입니다. 합치지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Elk beeld is een aparte foto van één beeld. Er wordt niets samengevoegd."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cada quadro é uma foto separada de quadro único. Nada é mesclado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "每一帧都是独立的单帧照片，不会合并。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "每一幀都是獨立的單幀照片，不會合併。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each photo is separate. Nothing is combined. Keep nope. open while the series runs.": {
      "comment": "Explains interval shooting. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged: it is the app's name. Must not claim more than the English.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Jedes Foto ist eigenständig. Nichts wird kombiniert. Lass nope. geöffnet, solange die Serie läuft."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cada foto es independiente. No se combina nada. Mantén nope. abierta mientras dure la serie."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Chaque photo est distincte. Rien n’est combiné. Gardez nope. ouverte pendant la série."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Ogni foto è separata. Nulla viene combinato. Tieni nope. aperta mentre la serie è in corso."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "各写真は個別です。合成は行いません。撮影中は nope. を開いたままにしてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "각 사진은 별개입니다. 합치지 않습니다. 촬영이 끝날 때까지 nope.를 열어 두십시오."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Elke foto is apart. Er wordt niets gecombineerd. Houd nope. open zolang de reeks loopt."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cada foto é separada. Nada é combinado. Mantenha o nope. aberto enquanto a série durar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "每张照片都是独立的，不会合并。拍摄期间请保持 nope. 打开。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "每張照片都是獨立的，不會合併。拍攝期間請保持 nope. 開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
